ted-list{display:grid;gap:6px;margin:10px 0}.selected-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;background:#111a28}.selected-line small{color:var(--muted)}.notice{font-size:.77rem;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px;margin-top:10px}.notice strong{color:var(--mint)}
@media(max-width:980px){.offer-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:650px){.offer-row,.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-grid .wide{grid-column:auto}.selected-line{display:block}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="bar"><div class="mark">£+</div><div><h1>JM Money Menu · Public Contact Carrier v1.2</h1><div class="sub">v1.1 authority data · 242 routes · enquiry → brief → scope → receipt</div></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="../" aria-label="Return to JM Web Estate">Estate</a><button class="btn" id="receiptBtn"><span class="label">Authority </span>Receipt</button><button class="btn" id="enquiryBtn"><span class="label">Start </span>Enquiry</button><button class="btn primary" id="exportBtn"><span class="label">Export </span>JSON</button></div></div></header>
<div class="shell">
<section class="hero"><div class="heroMain"><div class="eyebrow">PUBLIC CONTACT DESCENDANT / v1.1 DATA AUTHORITY PRESERVED</div><h2>Value has <span>routes.</span></h2><p>This public carrier preserves the verified 242-route v1.1 authority data and adds a local-first commercial handoff: shortlist → enquiry → brief → scope → receipt → email/share. Nothing is silently submitted.</p><div class="law">ROUTE CONTACTS BODY; BODY IDENTITY REMAINS SOVEREIGN.</div><div class="contact-law">PUBLIC CONTACT IS USER-CONTROLLED: BUILD THE PACK → REVIEW IT → SEND OR SHARE IT.</div></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b>242</b><span>governed routes</span></div><div class="stat"><b>32/32</b><span>immediate IDs found</span></div><div class="stat"><b>160/160</b><span>five-field parity checks</span></div><div class="stat"><b>PASS</b><span>authority gate</span></div></div></section>
<section class="panel proof"><div><b>Direct source</b><span>Money Menu Growth Ledger v1.0</span></div><div><b>Authority repair</b><span>231-route v0.8 → 242-route v1.0</span></div><div><b>Carrier route</b><span>money-menu/index.html · public v1.2</span></div><div><b>Claim boundary</b><span>Descendant ≠ lost 67,371-byte ancestor</span></div></section>

<section class="panel front-window" aria-labelledby="frontWindowTitle"><div class="front-window-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">FRONT WINDOW · FIVE CLEAR ENTRY ROUTES</div><h2 id="frontWindowTitle">Start with a route. Keep the full 242 behind it.</h2><p>Tap an offer to shortlist its exact governed route, then build an enquiry pack.</p></div><button class="btn primary" id="frontEnquiryBtn">Build enquiry pack</button></div><div class="offer-row" id="frontOffers"></div></section>
<section class="controls"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search route, house, state, source or boundary…"><select id="house"><option value="">All houses</option></select><select id="state"><option value="">All states</option></select><select id="sort"><option value="source">Source order</option><option value="title">Title A–Z</option><option value="house">House A–Z</option><option value="state">State A–Z</option></select></section>
<div class="statusline"><span><b id="shown">242</b> routes shown</span><span><b id="selected">0</b> shortlisted</span></div>
<main class="grid" id="grid"></main>
<footer>No Ding, no claim. v1.1 remains the data authority; v1.2 is the public contact descendant. Enquiry packs are requests, not accepted contracts.</footer>
</div>
<dialog id="receiptDlg"><div class="dlgHead"><h2>Authority reconciliation & parity receipt</h2><button class="btn" id="closeReceipt">Close</button></div><div class="dlgBody"><div class="receipt" id="receiptText"></div></div></dialog>
<dialog id="enquiryDlg"><div class="dlgHead"><h2>Enquiry → brief → scope → receipt</h2><button class="btn" id="closeEnquiry">Close</button></div><div class="dlgBody"><form id="enquiryForm"><div class="form-grid"><label>Name / organisation<input id="clientName" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name or organisation"></label><label>Reply contact<input id="clientContact" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Email, phone or preferred route"></label><label>Budget field<select id="clientBudget"><option>Not decided</option><option>Under £300</option><option>£300–£750</option><option>£750–£1,500</option><option>£1,500–£3,000</option><option>£3,000+</option></select></label><label>Timing<select id="clientTiming"><option>Exploring</option><option>As soon as possible</option><option>Within 2 weeks</option><option>Within 1 month</option><option>Flexible / staged</option></select></label><label class="wide">What needs to change?<textarea id="clientNeed" placeholder="Describe the present problem, desired result, device/platform, deadline and anything that must be preserved."></textarea></label><label class="wide">Conditions / boundaries<textarea id="clientBoundary" placeholder="Privacy, access, ownership, format, budget, proof or delivery boundaries."></textarea></label></div><div class="selected-list" id="enquirySelected"></div><div class="scope-actions"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Build scope receipt</button><button class="btn" type="button" id="copyScope">Copy</button><button class="btn" type="button" id="downloadScopeJson">JSON</button><button class="btn" type="button" id="downloadScopeText">Text</button><button class="btn" type="button" id="shareScope">Share</button><button class="btn" type="button" id="emailScope">Open email draft</button></div><div class="notice"><strong>No silent submission.</strong> The pack stays in this browser until you copy, download, share or open the email draft. The email button targets the public repository-author contact route.</div><pre class="receipt scope-box" id="scopePreview">Select at least one route, add the brief, then build the scope receipt.</pre></form></div></dialog>
<script>const PAYLOAD="